    "url": "https://help.appenate.com/article/update-showcase-cango-caves/",
    "title": "Cango Caves Update (2023)",
    "content": "Blog\n\n\n\nThis showcase touches on our Cango Caves Update, from live features and where to find them to insight into soon-to-be-released functionality.\n\n\n\nPlease familiarize yourself with the blog and then jump into the bridging-gap crash course below before closely examining what’s new and changed in our support documentation.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nShowcase\n\n\n\nViewers’ discretion is advised as the run-through you’re about to hit play on may or may not thrill at this time, but it should get you swiftly up to speed, formulating new use cases and testing platform functionality in no time.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nUpdates\n\n\n\nWith each new prominent feature or minor change, our knowledge base content is generally updated by additions to existing or new articles created.\n\n\n\nWhat’s New\n\n\n\nEdge UsersEdge UsersWeb FormsWeb Forms (Add-On)Nested RepeatsNesting Repeatable DataPostgreSQL IntegrationsAdding a PostgreSQL ConnectionPostgreSQL – Form ConnectorPostgreSQL – Data Source ConnectorMySQL IntegrationsAdding a MySQL ConnectionMySQL – Form ConnectorMySQL – Data Source Connector\n\n\n\nWhat’s Changed\n\n\n\nApp Launch Rules – List of ValuesLaunching Your App From A URL (App Links / Deep Linking)Windows branded app code signing certificateWindows App Code SigningTask templates – Default filters set to allTask TemplatesRefined invalid formula responses in Formula BuilderCreating a FormulaSupport for Dutch translation in-appMulti-Language Support For FormsStandard vs Premium User LicensesStandard vs Premium vs Grandfather User LicencesRepeatable DataCapturing Repeatable DataOutputting Repeatable DataTechnical Information – Intruder.ioNetwork Penetration and Application Security TestingUnicode Character SupportOutputting Checkboxes, Hyperlinks and Other Special Characters (Unicode support)",
    "html_content": "\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Blog</h1>\n\n\n\n<p>This showcase touches on our <a href=\"https://www.appenate.com/platform-updates/cango-caves-update-adding-more-under-the-hood/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cango Caves Update</a>, from live features and where to find them to insight into soon-to-be-released functionality.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Please familiarize yourself with the blog and then jump into the <em>bridging-gap crash course</em> below before closely examining what’s new and changed in our support documentation.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Showcase</h1>\n\n\n\n<p>Viewers’ discretion is <em>advised&nbsp;</em>as the run-through you’re about to hit <strong>play&nbsp;</strong>on may or may not thrill at this time, but it should get you swiftly up to speed, formulating new use cases and testing platform functionality in no time.</p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"padding: 63.75% 0 0 0; position: relative;\"><iframe style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" title=\"Update Showcase - Cango Caves\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/843161865?badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" frameborder=\"0\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Updates</h1>\n\n\n\n<p>With each new prominent feature or minor change, our knowledge base content is <em>generally&nbsp;</em>updated by additions to existing or new articles created.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What’s New</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table fr-alternate-rows fr-no-borders\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td>Edge Users</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/edge-users/\">Edge Users</a></td></tr><tr><td>Web Forms</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/web-formsadd-on/\">Web Forms (Add-On)</a></td></tr><tr><td>Nested Repeats</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/nesting-repeatable-data/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Nesting Repeatable Data</a></td></tr><tr><td>PostgreSQL Integrations</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/adding-a-postgresql-connection/\">Adding a PostgreSQL Connection</a><br><br><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/postgresql-form-connector/\">PostgreSQL – Form Connector</a><br><br><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/postgresql-data-source-connector/\">PostgreSQL – Data Source Connector</a></td></tr><tr><td>MySQL Integrations</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/adding-a-mysql-connection/\">Adding a MySQL Connection</a><br><br><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/mysql-form-connector/\">MySQL – Form Connector</a><br><br><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/mysql-data-source-connector/\">MySQL – Data Source Connector</a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What’s Changed</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table fr-alternate-rows fr-no-borders\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td>App Launch Rules – List of Values</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/launching-your-app-from-a-urlapp-links-deep-linking/\">Launching Your App From A URL (App Links / Deep Linking)</a></td></tr><tr><td>Windows branded app code signing certificate</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/windows-app-code-signing/\">Windows App Code Signing</a></td></tr><tr><td>Task templates – Default filters set to all</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/task-templates/\">Task Templates</a></td></tr><tr><td>Refined invalid formula responses in Formula Builder</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/creating-a-formula/\">Creating a Formula</a></td></tr><tr><td>Support for Dutch translation in-app</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/multi-language-support-for-forms/\">Multi-Language Support For Forms</a><br><br><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/standard-vs-premium-user-licenses/\">Standard vs Premium User Licenses</a><br><br><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/standard-vs-premium-vs-grandfather-user-licences/\">Standard vs Premium vs Grandfather User Licences</a></td></tr><tr><td>Repeatable Data</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/capturing-repeatable-data/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Capturing Repeatable Data</a><br><p><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/outputting-repeatable-data/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Outputting Repeatable Data</a></p><br></td></tr><tr><td>Technical Information – Intruder.io</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/vulnerability-scans-and-penetration-testing/\">Network Penetration and Application Security Testing</a></td></tr><tr><td>Unicode Character Support</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/outputting-checkboxes-hyperlinks-and-other-special-charactersunicode-support/\">Outputting Checkboxes, Hyperlinks and Other Special Characters (Unicode support)</a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
