    "id": 313,
    "url": "https://help.appenate.com/article/webinar-glass-house-mountains-update/",
    "title": "Glass House Mountains Update (2023)",
    "content": "Blog\n\n\n\nOur blog covers features and functionality for the Glass House Mountains Update, Creating An Even Better User Experience.\n\n\n\nIf you’re familiar with its contents, view the Webinar’s recording for an in-depth run-through or jump straight into our supporting knowledgebase updates.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWebinar\n\n\n\nThe recording touches on all features released and a “bonus” Examples Catalog app that can be installed from the How-Tos category, Task Calendar App.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nUpdates\n\n\n\nKnowledgebase article updates and new content created for the Glass House Mountains release, providing additional information, functionality settings, and examples.\n\n\n\nFeatureContentArticle“Catapult” Form ConverterNewDocument ConverterOverlay An Image On The Media FieldUpdateMedia Field TypeIsolate Text On OCR FieldUpdateOCR Field TypeEnable Email-Less LoginNewEmail-less LoginImprovements To Our Notifications Area\n\nNotification When Connectors Are Stuck Due To Media Files\nNotification Logs To Manage Pending Connectors\n\nNewNotification LogsCustom Categories For Examples CatalogNewCustom Categories for Examples CatalogWhitelist And Embed The Web Portal Into An iFrame (WaaS)UpdateCustomizing your WaaSChoices Field CheckboxesUpdateChoices Field Type",
    "html_content": "\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Blog</h1>\n\n\n\n<p>Our blog covers features and functionality for the <a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/webinar-glass-house-mountains-update/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Glass House Mountains Update, Creating An Even Better User Experience</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you’re familiar with its contents, view the Webinar’s recording for an in-depth run-through or jump straight into our supporting knowledgebase updates.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Webinar</h1>\n\n\n\n<p>The recording touches on all features released and a “bonus” Examples Catalog app that can be installed from the How-Tos category, Task Calendar App.</p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;\"><iframe style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" title=\"Webinar: Glass House Mountains\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/883868217?h=66f74d9b9d&amp;badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;quality_selector=1&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" frameborder=\"0\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Updates</h1>\n\n\n\n<p>Knowledgebase article updates and new content created for the Glass House Mountains release, providing additional information, functionality settings, and examples.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table fr-alternate-rows\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong data-identifyelement=\"508\">Feature</strong></td><td><strong data-identifyelement=\"510\">Content</strong></td><td><strong data-identifyelement=\"512\">Article</strong></td></tr><tr><td>“Catapult” Form Converter</td><td>New</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/document-converter/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Document Converter</a></td></tr><tr><td>Overlay An Image On The Media Field</td><td>Update</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/media-field-type/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Media Field Type</a></td></tr><tr><td>Isolate Text On OCR Field</td><td>Update</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/ocr-field-type/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">OCR Field Type</a></td></tr><tr><td>Enable Email-Less Login</td><td>New</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/email-less-login/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Email-less Login</a></td></tr><tr><td>Improvements To Our Notifications Area\n<ul data-identifyelement=\"537\">\n<li dir=\"ltr\" data-identifyelement=\"538\">Notification When Connectors Are Stuck Due To Media Files</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" data-identifyelement=\"539\">Notification Logs To Manage Pending Connectors</li>\n</ul>\n</td><td>New</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/notification-logs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Notification Logs</a></td></tr><tr><td>Custom Categories For Examples Catalog</td><td>New</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/custom-categories-for-examples-catalog/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Custom Categories for Examples Catalog</a></td></tr><tr><td>Whitelist And Embed The Web Portal Into An iFrame (WaaS)</td><td>Update</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/customizing-your-waas/\">Customizing your WaaS</a></td></tr><tr><td>Choices Field Checkboxes</td><td>Update</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/choices-field-type/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Choices Field Type</a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n",
