    "title": "Iguazú Falls Update (2024)",
    "content": "Blog\n\n\n\nOur blog covers features and functionality for the Iguazú Falls Update: A Refreshing Surge In Your Platform Experience.\n\n\n\nIf you’re familiar with its contents, view the Webinar’s recording for an in-depth run-through or jump straight into our supporting knowledgebase updates.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWebinar\n\n\n\nThe recording touches on all features released and where to find them on the web portal and in-app.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nUpdates\n\n\n\nKnowledgebase article updates and new content created for the Iguazú Falls release, providing additional information and functionality settings.\n\n\n\nFeatureContentArticleWeb portal Multi-languageNewMulti-Language Apps and Web PortalUSERLANG() FunctionUpdateFormula Cheat SheetEnhanced Email Deliverability with DKIMUpdateConfigure Email Support for Your Custom Domain (SPF & DKIM)App “On Form Upload” InteractionNewScreen Title TypeStreamlined Connector Handling with RepositoriesUpdateCopying Content Between Environments (via the Repository) Copying Content Between Accounts Using the RepositoryEnhanced History SearchUpdateForm SettingsMinimum OS Version RequirementNewApp Settings",
    "html_content": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Blog</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-roboto-font-family\">Our blog covers features and functionality for the <a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://appenate.com/platform-updates/iguazu-falls-update-a-refreshing-surge-in-your-platform-experience/?vgo_ee=1SmCpvC3drMg%2BBHNAPlJikzE9Wodp9degQHpmFSpGXy7ww%3D%3D%3Agrt1eYyPqgguNPHmdUtZgdRg40NXHlBg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Iguazú Falls Update: A Refreshing Surge In Your Platform Experience</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-roboto-font-family\">If you’re familiar with its contents, view the Webinar’s recording for an in-depth run-through or jump straight into our supporting knowledgebase updates.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Webinar</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The recording touches on all features released and where to find them on the web portal and in-app.</p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"padding:66.58% 0 0 0;position:relative;\"><iframe src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/939134043?badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write; encrypted-media\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" title=\"Webinar: Iguazu Falls Update\" data-ready=\"true\"></iframe></div><script src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js\"></script>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Updates</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Knowledgebase article updates and new content created for the Iguazú Falls release, providing additional information and functionality settings.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table fr-alternate-rows\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Feature</strong></td><td><strong>Content</strong></td><td><strong dir=\"ltr\">Article</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Web portal Multi-language</td><td>New</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/multi-language-apps-and-web-portal/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Multi-Language Apps and Web Portal</a></td></tr><tr><td>USERLANG() Function</td><td>Update</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/formula-cheat-sheet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Formula Cheat Sheet</a></td></tr><tr><td>Enhanced Email Deliverability with DKIM</td><td>Update</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/configure-email-support-for-your-custom-domainspf-dkim/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Configure Email Support for Your Custom Domain (SPF &amp; DKIM)</a></td></tr><tr><td>App “On Form Upload” Interaction</td><td>New</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/screen-title-type/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Screen Title Type</a></td></tr><tr><td>Streamlined Connector Handling with Repositories</td><td>Update</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/copying-content-between-environmentsvia-the-repository/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Copying Content Between Environments (via the Repository)</a> <p><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/copying-content-between-accounts-using-the-repository/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Copying Content Between Accounts Using the Repository</a></p></td></tr><tr><td>Enhanced History Search</td><td>Update</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/form-settings/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Form Settings</a></td></tr><tr><td>Minimum OS Version Requirement</td><td>New</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/app-settings/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">App Settings</a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n",
