    "id": 323,
    "url": "https://help.appenate.com/article/webinar-richtersveld-update/",
    "title": "Richtersveld Update (2024)",
    "content": "Blog\n\n\n\nOur blog covers features and functionality for the Richtersveld Update, which brings a slew of insights and eagerly awaited Xero integrations.\n\n\n\nFor those familiar with the material, consider watching the webinar recording for a comprehensive review or dive directly into the latest updates in our knowledge base.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWebinar\n\n\n\nThe recording provides an overview of all the newly released features and guides on how to implement them within the web portal and the app.\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nUpdates\n\n\n\nUpdates to knowledgebase articles and the creation of new content for the Richtersveld release, offering expanded information and functionality settings.\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nFeatureContentArticleXero ConnectorsNewAdding a Xero ConnectionXero – Form ConnectorXero Files – Form ConnectorXero – Data Source ConnectorEnabling Xero ConnectionsIconsUpdateCustom IconsPopulate Gallery Field from Data SourceUpdateGallery Field TypeAdd User Groups To Test ScreensUpdateTesting Your Screen Designs (TEST Mode)Zoom & PanUpdateMedia Field TypeNew Insights on the Billable Users PageNewBillable User InsightsReport of Screen ChangesUpdateForm SettingsBigQuery Implement PagingUpdateGoogle BigQuery – Data Source ConnectorUpdate Specific Columns via Datasource APIUpdatePUT Data SourceRetrieve Tasks by External ID via APIUpdateGET Task (Search)Background UploadsNewImproved Background Uploading",
    "html_content": "\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Blog</h1>\n\n\n\n<p>Our blog covers features and functionality for the <a href=\"https://www.appenate.com/platform-updates/richtersveld-update-xero-connector-more/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-identifyelement=\"479\">Richtersveld Update</a>, which brings a slew of insights and eagerly awaited Xero integrations.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For those familiar with the material, consider watching the webinar recording for a comprehensive review or dive directly into the latest updates in our knowledge base.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Webinar</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The recording provides an overview of all the newly released features and guides on how to implement them within the web portal and the app.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"padding: 63.75% 0px 0px; position: relative;\" data-identifyelement=\"481\"><iframe style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" title=\"Webinar - Richtersveld Update\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1019315463?badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" frameborder=\"0\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\" data-identifyelement=\"482\"></iframe></div>\n\n\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Updates</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Updates to knowledgebase articles and the creation of new content for the Richtersveld release, offering expanded information and functionality settings.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table fr-alternate-rows\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong data-identifyelement=\"500\">Feature</strong></td><td><strong data-identifyelement=\"503\">Content</strong></td><td><strong data-identifyelement=\"505\">Article</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Xero Connectors</td><td>New</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/adding-a-xero-connection/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-identifyelement=\"510\">Adding a Xero Connection</a><br data-identifyelement=\"513\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/xero-form-connector/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-identifyelement=\"514\">Xero – Form Connector</a><br data-identifyelement=\"515\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/xero-files-form-connector/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-identifyelement=\"516\">Xero Files – Form Connector</a><br data-identifyelement=\"517\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/xero-data-source-connector/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-identifyelement=\"518\">Xero – Data Source Connector</a><br data-identifyelement=\"519\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/enabling-xero-connections/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-identifyelement=\"468\">Enabling Xero Connections</a></td></tr><tr><td>Icons</td><td>Update</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/custom-icons/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-identifyelement=\"527\">Custom Icons</a></td></tr><tr><td>Populate Gallery Field from Data Source</td><td>Update</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/gallery-field-type/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-identifyelement=\"534\">Gallery Field Type</a></td></tr><tr><td>Add User Groups To Test Screens</td><td>Update</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/testing-your-screen-designstest-mode/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-identifyelement=\"541\">Testing Your Screen Designs (TEST Mode)</a></td></tr><tr><td>Zoom &amp; Pan</td><td>Update</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/media-field-type/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-identifyelement=\"548\">Media Field Type</a></td></tr><tr><td>New Insights on the Billable Users Page</td><td>New</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/billable-user-insights/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-identifyelement=\"469\">Billable User Insights</a></td></tr><tr><td>Report of Screen Changes</td><td>Update</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/form-settings/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-identifyelement=\"470\">Form Settings</a></td></tr><tr><td>BigQuery Implement Paging</td><td>Update</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/google-bigquery-data-source-connector/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-identifyelement=\"569\">Google BigQuery – Data Source Connector</a></td></tr><tr><td>Update Specific Columns via Datasource API</td><td>Update</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/put-data-source-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-identifyelement=\"576\">PUT Data Source</a></td></tr><tr><td>Retrieve Tasks by External ID via API</td><td>Update</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/get-tasksearch/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-identifyelement=\"583\">GET Task (Search)</a></td></tr><tr><td>Background Uploads</td><td>New</td><td><a href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/improved-background-uploading/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Improved Background Uploading</a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n",
