    "id": 324,
    "url": "https://help.appenate.com/article/webinar-rottnest-island-update/",
    "title": "Rottnest Island Update (2024)",
    "content": "Blog\n\n\n\nWe’re wrapping up the year with our Rottnest Island Update! With customization to task notifications and process steps, new and improved formulas, and API additions, there’s bound to be a feature to improve your current digital solutions.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVideo\n\n\n\nThis recording will walk you through new and updated features, starting with a high-level overview and then diving into functionality to familiarize you swiftly with our latest release.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nUpdates\n\n\n\nA concise list of updated and newly created content in our support knowledge base can be perused below.\n\n\n\nFeatureContentArticlesInfo Alert CustomizationUpdateApp Setup Page.Tasks OverviewSimplified Google Integrations with the New Folder PickerUpdateAdding a Google Drive & Spreadsheets ConnectionDynamically Evaluate Text as a FormulaNew.UpdateEvaluate Text as a Formula.Formula Cheat SheetTask Recurring APINewTask Recurring APIGetting the User ID from the API Explorer/ API ResponseUpdateGET User (User Search)GET User (Details)Amazon Web Services Integration EnhancementUpdateAdding an Amazon S3 ConnectionToggle Table Search BarUpdateTable Field TypeNew Formula for Device NameUpdateFormula Cheat SheetProcess Step Button Color ChangeUpdateProcess Field Type (2-Step Workflow)Workflow A Form Entry Between Users (Process Steps)",
    "html_content": "\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Blog</h1>\n\n\n\n<p>We’re wrapping up the year with our <a href=\"https://www.appenate.com/platform-updates/rottnest-island-update/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Rottnest Island Update</a>! With customization to task notifications and process steps, new and improved formulas, and API additions, there’s bound to be a feature to improve your current digital solutions.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Video</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>This recording will walk you through new and updated features, starting with a high-level overview and then diving into functionality to familiarize you swiftly with our latest release.</p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"padding: 59.54% 0 0 0; position: relative;\"><iframe style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" title=\"Rottnest Island Release\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1040955443?badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" frameborder=\"0\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Updates</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>A concise list of updated and newly created content in our support knowledge base can be perused below.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table fr-alternate-rows\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong dir=\"ltr\">Feature</strong></td><td><strong>Content</strong></td><td><strong dir=\"ltr\">Articles</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Info Alert Customization</td><td>Update</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/app-setup-page/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">App Setup Page</a><span style=\"color: #f5f5f5;\">.</span><br><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/overview-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tasks Overview</a></td></tr><tr><td>Simplified Google Integrations with the New Folder Picker</td><td>Update</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/adding-a-google-drive-spreadsheets-connection/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Adding a Google Drive &amp; Spreadsheets Connection</a></td></tr><tr><td>Dynamically Evaluate Text as a Formula</td><td>New<span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">.</span><br>Update</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/evaluate-text-as-a-formula/#EVAL()-Function-Explained\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Evaluate Text as a Formula</a><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">.</span><br><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/formula-cheat-sheet/#6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Formula Cheat Sheet</a></td></tr><tr><td>Task Recurring API</td><td>New</td><td><a href=\"https://support.appenate.com/support/solutions/folders/11000021942\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Task Recurring API</a></td></tr><tr><td>Getting the User ID from the API Explorer/ API Response</td><td>Update</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/get-useruser-search/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GET User (User Search)</a><br><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/get-userdetails/\">GET User (Details)</a></td></tr><tr><td>Amazon Web Services Integration Enhancement</td><td>Update</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/adding-an-amazon-s3-connection/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Adding an Amazon S3 Connection</a></td></tr><tr><td>Toggle Table Search Bar</td><td>Update</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/table-field-type/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Table Field Type</a></td></tr><tr><td>New Formula for Device Name</td><td>Update</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/formula-cheat-sheet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Formula Cheat Sheet</a></td></tr><tr><td>Process Step Button Color Change</td><td>Update</td><td><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/process-field-type2-step-workflow/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Process Field Type (2-Step Workflow)</a><br><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.appenate.com/article/workflow-a-form-entry-between-usersprocess-steps/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Workflow A Form Entry Between Users (Process Steps)</a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n",
    "category": "Getting Started",
    "scraped_at": "2025-10-21T18:03:16.779242"
